sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant CLI as main.py
    participant V as Validation
    participant T as TransactionService
    participant S as JsonStorage

    Student->>CLI: Select Add Expense
    CLI->>V: Validate description/amount/date
    V-->>CLI: Valid input
    CLI->>T: add_transaction(...)
    T->>S: load()
    S-->>T: Existing data
    T->>S: save(updated data)
    S-->>T: Saved
    T-->>CLI: Transaction created
    CLI-->>Student: Success message
